              "# Industrial Production Operation in April 2019\nIn April 2019, the total value added of the industrial enterprises above designated size was up by 5.4 percent year-on-year in real terms (the following growth rates of value added are real growth rates, after deducting price factors), a decrease of 3.1 percentage points from that in the first three months. In April, the total value added of the industrial enterprises above designated size went up by 0.37 percent month-on-month",
